Hello,

We have reports of 17 patients with gastrointestinal illness from the same
area of Kalundborg across 14 and 15 December. This is above the level we
usually see for this area and time of year. I do not have a comparable
baseline count to send with this alert.

Reported symptoms include watery diarrhoea. Nine patients had vomiting and
eight had fever. Most recovered in less than two days.

This is an aggregate update. It gives no individual dates of symptom onset.
We cannot tell from these records if any of these patients were also
reported through the day-care centre or the apartment building.

Out-of-hours duty clinician
